{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-023",
    "title": "顾氏旧债"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_120",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "顾长离推开木匣。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "雪原的夜比山门更冷。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3839,
          "end": 3839
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临、顾长离和叶观澜沿山脊走了两日，终于在一处背风的岩洞里停下。第三盏灯的青光时隐时现，始终在他们前方十里之外。每当陆照临试图靠近，灯光便向后退，像故意保持一段无法追上的距离。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3841,
          "end": 3841
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜在洞口布下三道铜线：“今晚不能再走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3843,
          "end": 3843
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“追兵呢？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3845,
          "end": 3845
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“玄霄宗的人被雪雾困住了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3847,
          "end": 3847
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们会追上来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3849,
          "end": 3849
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以你要尽快学会使用残印。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3851,
          "end": 3851
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向两枚灰白石片。它们被分开放在岩石两端，彼此之间隔着一条细缝。掌心残印与石片相触时，会产生短暂共鸣，却无法完整拼合。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3853,
          "end": 3853
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“会伤到经脉。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3879,
          "end": 3879
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你若只守气海，永远打不开第二道门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3881,
          "end": 3881
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临咬牙承受。青光经过胸口时，眼前忽然浮出雪地影像。年幼的自己站在老槐树下，陆沉舟把一盏空灯放到他手里。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3883,
          "end": 3883
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记住第三盏灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3885,
          "end": 3885
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它为什么没有火？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3887,
          "end": 3887
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为火会让它找到你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3889,
          "end": 3889
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "影像中的陆沉舟抬头看向屋檐，那里挂着一串铜片。铜片上刻着三个名字：陆、顾、叶。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3891,
          "end": 3891
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临想伸手看清最后一个字，影像却突然碎裂。青光冲入眉心，他整个人向后倒去。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3893,
          "end": 3893
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离将他扶住：“停下！”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3895,
          "end": 3895
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临睁开眼，耳边嗡鸣不止。他看见岩洞里多了一盏灯，灯罩内的火焰是白色的。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3897,
          "end": 3897
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那不是我们的灯。”叶观澜拔刀。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3899,
          "end": 3899
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "白灯悬在半空，火焰里浮出一行字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3901,
          "end": 3901
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“金丹之前，不可开门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3903,
          "end": 3903
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离问：“谁写的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3905,
          "end": 3905
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“太虚遗脉。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3907,
          "end": 3907
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临撑起身体：“它为什么提醒我们？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3909,
          "end": 3909
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它不是提醒，是限制。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3911,
          "end": 3911
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "白灯火焰骤然一缩，岩洞外的雪雾向内翻涌。三道铜线同时震动，叶观澜被逼退半步。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3913,
          "end": 3913
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“玄霄宗的人来了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3915,
          "end": 3915
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "洞外传来灰袍修士的声音：“陆照临，交还残印，宗门可保你筑基。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3917,
          "end": 3917
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜冷笑：“你们什么时候学会替人许诺境界？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3919,
          "end": 3919
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“太虚遗脉已经标记他。没有宗门护持，他活不过金丹劫。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3921,
          "end": 3921
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看向陆照临：“你感觉如何？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3923,
          "end": 3923
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临检查经脉。寒流已经退去，气海却比原先沉重许多。那一缕灵气不再散开，稳稳停在气海中央，像一粒冰珠。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3925,
          "end": 3925
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“炼气三层。”他说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3927,
          "end": 3927
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“只是一层？”叶观澜问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3929,
          "end": 3929
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“借来的火，能留下多少已经算多。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3931,
          "end": 3931
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "洞外剑光划过雪幕。玄霄宗弟子开始破阵，铜线一根根崩断。白灯仍悬在岩洞中，火焰没有受到影响。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3933,
          "end": 3933
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向它：“如果我点亮白灯，会怎样？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3935,
          "end": 3935
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你会打开一道门。”慧闻的声音从洞外传来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3937,
          "end": 3937
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "众人回头。灰衣僧人站在雪中，木珠缠在手腕，脚边没有脚印。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3939,
          "end": 3939
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜皱眉：“你怎么找到我们的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3941,
          "end": 3941
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我没有找你们，是你们的记忆带我来的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3943,
          "end": 3943
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻走进岩洞，抬头看白灯：“这不是第三盏灯，是门的影子。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3945,
          "end": 3945
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第三盏灯在哪里？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3947,
          "end": 3947
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“在你不愿记起的地方。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3949,
          "end": 3949
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“又是这句话。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3951,
          "end": 3951
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为你每次借火，都会把一部分记忆交给它。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3953,
          "end": 3953
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临低头。掌心残印边缘多出一道细小裂纹，像某段记忆被从里面剥走。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3955,
          "end": 3955
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临怔住。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3961,
          "end": 3961
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜在旁边笑了一声：“借火的代价来得很快。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4039,
          "end": 4039
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临没有理会。他掌心残印的空白比昨夜更大，像有人从里面挖走了一小块。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4041,
          "end": 4041
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "山谷入口立着两根断柱。柱上顾氏旧印已经被刮去，只留一圈浅痕。顾长离取出铜针，插入右侧柱脚的孔洞，石壁随即向内凹陷，露出一道窄门。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4043,
          "end": 4043
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门后是顾氏旧库。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4045,
          "end": 4045
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "库房里没有灵石和法器，只有一排排木匣。每只木匣都贴着账页，账页上记录灯具、铜丝和封存材料的去向。最靠里的木匣被铁链锁住，锁面刻着“归墟灵城”五字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4047,
          "end": 4047
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离走到锁前，手指悬在刻痕上方。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4049,
          "end": 4049
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你有钥匙？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4051,
          "end": 4051
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“没有。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4053,
          "end": 4053
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那怎么开？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4055,
          "end": 4055
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“用顾氏的债。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4057,
          "end": 4057
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她从袖中取出那枚旧印，按在锁面。铁链没有断，锁芯却发出咔的一声。门内响起纸张翻动的声音，像有人在黑暗里等待核对账目。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4059,
          "end": 4059
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离推开木匣。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4061,
          "end": 4061
        }
      }
    ],
